  "title": "CSG Systems International Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results",
  "summary": "CSG® (NASDAQ: CSGS) today reported results for the quarter and year ended December 31, 2025. Financial Results: Fourth quarter 2025 financial results: Total revenue was $323.1 million . GAAP operating income was $29.1 million , or an operating margin of 9.0% , and non-GAAP operating income was $65.8 million , or a non-GAAP adjusted operating margin of 22.3% . GAAP earnings per diluted share (EPS) was $0.25 and non-GAAP EPS was $1.53 . Cash flows from operations were $59.2 million , with non-GAAP",
